  flowchart TD
    A[ScheduleOnce delay, f] --> N{f is nil?}
    N -->|yes| E[ErrNilCallback, nothing armed]
    N -->|no| C{scheduler closed?}
    C -->|yes| EC[ErrSchedulerClosed, nothing armed]
    C -->|no| D{delay at or below 0?}
    D -->|yes| X[executor runs f at once, handle not cancellable]
    D -->|no| T[arm System Clock, handle cancellable]
    T -->|clock fires| F{fire wins and scheduler open?}
    F -->|yes| X2[executor runs f]
    F -->|no| S[nothing runs]
